@paul-uz, I did a quick search and `@opensearch-project/opensearch` is heavily dependent on standard Node.js modules (e.g. `https`, `http`, some functions in `util` and `streams` which are not web standards).

LLRT has `https` and `http` on its roadmap, but nothing else. It's possible that modules not on the roadmap will be supported in the future, but we don't know at this time.

