The `dynamodb-admin` service is working correctly, which further supports the functionality of the local setup. However, I am not familiar with the structure or the specific packages used in its development. This successful integration highlights the functioning local environment setup but also emphasizes the issue likely being specific to the Lambda runtime environment's compatibility or interaction with the `@aws-sdk/client-dynamodb` package.

